17. Don't confuse these 7 components

For interviews, keep this mental table:

Component	Remember it as
API Server	Front door
etcd	Cluster database/memory
Scheduler	Chooses Worker Node
Controller Manager	Reconciles desired vs actual state
Kubelet	Node agent managing assigned Pods
Container Runtime	Actually runs containers
kube-proxy	Common implementation layer for Service traffic
